SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] MHRC and MDOL\, along with Clara Porter from 
 Prevention\, Action\, Change\, and Peter Lowe\, Esq.\, from Brann & Isaacs
 on\, present a joint training on sexual harassment in the workplace. This 
 training can be used by employers to comply with the 26 M.R.S. Section 807
  requirement to provide training to new employees. Please note that presen
 ting this training alone does not meet the training requirement for superv
 isory and managerial employees. This video is ASL-interpreted.
